cff-version: 1.2.0
message: "If this code is used, please cite the article below."
title: "Enhancement-Disentangled Modelling for T1-CE Meningioma Synthesis: analysis and modelling code"
abstract: >-
  Analysis and modelling code for the synthesis of contrast-enhanced
  T1-weighted MRI of meningioma from non-contrast T1, T2 and FLAIR.
  Contains the evaluated configurations, the training and evaluation
  pipelines, the metric definitions and the patient-level statistical
  analysis. No patient imaging data and no trained weights are included.
type: software
